    {
      "id": "2068a443-75b1-4f58-9a83-2bf4289dffa9",
      "name": "Sticky Note a72730e9",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -144,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 428,
        "height": 380,
        "content": "## Client Onboarding & Delivery Control Tower\n\nReusable paid-template architecture for agencies and service teams. Configure OpenAI, Gmail, approval recipients, the audit sheet and the provisioning adapter before activation.\n\nEntry points: intake webhook, approval webhook and daily control sweep. Principles: validate early, structured AI analysis, human approval for risk, duplicate prevention and auditability."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "7afdd10c-a54c-439f-8050-85cd211b1b7c",
      "name": "Sticky Note 6a48fec1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        336,
        -96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 980,
        "height": 210,
        "content": "## Phase 1 \u2014 Intake, AI Analysis & Risk Routing\n\nNormalize body-wrapped requests, validate required fields, analyze scope and risk, then send low-risk work to provisioning while routing higher-risk work to approval or executive review. Persist the idempotency key before activation."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db627e9e-c651-48f8-b781-2aa6d408f872",
      "name": "Sticky Note bff1631f",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -80,
        432
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 1180,
        "height": 120,
        "content": "## Phase 2 \u2014 Approval, Provisioning, Escalation & Audit\n\nLow-risk requests create a project plan. Higher-risk requests require human review. Approved work is rehydrated; rejected work is paused. Connect project provisioning to Drive, Notion, ClickUp, Asana or another PM system. Protect approval webhooks with authentication."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
